{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27215","headline":"天门街西观荣王聘妃 · 张光朝","name":"天门街西观荣王聘妃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙媛来朱邸，名山出紫微。\n三周初展义，百两遂言归。\n郑国通梁苑，天津接帝畿。\n桥成乌鹊助，盖转凤皇飞。\n霜仗迎秋色，星缸满夜辉。\n从兹磐石固，应爲得贤妃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张光朝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}